[[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429398\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429401\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen band and disconnect the upper coolant inlet hose to the\nradiator thermostat side.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Recover the coolant which comes\nout in a suitable container.</p></aside><p>2. Undo the nuts (2a) and remove the thermostat unit (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043827.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428998\">1048A32</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen band and disconnect the upper coolant inlet hose to the\nradiator thermostat side.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Recover the coolant which comes\nout in a suitable container.</p></aside><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove thermostat assembly (2b)</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044040.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428998\">1048A32</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen band and disconnect the upper coolant inlet hose to the\nradiator thermostat side.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Recover the coolant which comes\nout in a suitable container.</p></aside><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the thermostat assembly (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044040.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the thermostat back in its housing\nand fix it tightening the nuts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>THERMOSTAT CONTAINER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the upper coolant inlet hose to\nthe radiator, thermostat side, and tighten the band.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429401\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429398\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428824\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the thermostat assembly (1a) back in its housing and secure\nit tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>THERMOSTAT CONTAINER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the upper coolant inlet hose to the radiator, thermostat\nside, and tighten the band.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044041.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the thermostat assembly (1a) back in its housing and secure\nit tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>THERMOSTAT CONTAINER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the upper coolant inlet hose to the radiator, thermostat\nside, and tighten the band.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044041.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428998\">1048A32</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428824\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[4,1,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428998\">1048A32</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2428824\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]